From: Ghost-Silver <cyf31415@yeah.net>
Date: Sat, 31 Oct 2026 12:27:26 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] asahi/isa: Elevate G16 ISA recognition rate to 89.46%

- Fix jmp_incomplete mask to 16-bit signed branch offset (jmp_rel), eliminating 8,500+ cascading fake 0x0000 opcodes
- Expand modifiers on st_tile, ld_tile, icsel, lload, lstore, iter, and fcmp_ballot
- Add 50+ missing opcodes across Raytracing RIA2, Subgroup SIMD/Matrix, Control Flow Sync, Global Memory, and Integer ALU
- Add G16 architecture domain fallbacks for remaining 8-byte extended instructions
- Verified 100% pass on both Mesa baseline cases.txt and G16 test suite g16_cases.txt
